          deckDescription: 'A 33-card German-suited pack: the standard 32 cards (Ace, King, Ober, Unter, Ten, Nine, Eight, Seven in each of bells, acorns, hearts, leaves) plus the Weli, the Six of Bells, which acts as a wild card (Perlagg).',
